  "aboutParagraphs": [
    "Acorn Park is Roseville's modern, intermediate-length course — 18 holes across rolling grassy hills mixed with woods, with a marsh in play and an unusual 26 baskets for 18 holes. Fifteen dual tees and eight dual baskets mean the same holes play fresh round after round.",
    "Free to play with concrete tees and Kingpin baskets, it's the 2015-era addition to the Twin Cities scene that intermediate players love — short enough to be fun, technical enough to teach.",
    "The marsh is the wild card after rain; the dual layouts are the reason locals never get bored."
  ],
