  "signatureHoleDescription": "Hole 7 is the longest at Acorn at 410 feet — a par 4 that stretches across the rolling grass before the marsh comes into play. It's the hole that gives the course its one big moment, and the one that separates a good score from a great one on this friendly, technical layout.",
  "localTips": "Fifteen dual tees and eight dual baskets mean you can play the same 18 holes a dozen different ways. The marsh is in play after rain on several holes. Free to play — a great intermediate practice loop.",
